sequenceDiagram
  participant K as Kasir (web/POS)
  participant S as sales
  participant P as payment
  participant F as finance
  K->>F: GET /finance/bank-accounts/options
  F-->>K: daftar rekening aktif + default
  K->>S: POST /sales-orders (receiptAccountId)
  S->>F: ValidateReceipt(accountId)
  S-->>K: order (rekening tujuan)
  K->>P: POST /payments (method=transfer, cashAccountId kosong/terisi)
  P->>S: receipt_account_id order (bila kosong)
  P->>F: ValidateReceipt(accountId)
  P-->>K: pembayaran (cash_account_id tersimpan)
  Note over F: posting / tutup harian
  F->>P: GetByID(payment)
  F->>F: buildPayment: leg kas = akun rekening (fallback mapping bank bila NULL)
